      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just noticed there is not only one request for this topic.\n\nYes this new window is super annoying and intrusive, things like this should not be there. Especially if you are already paying for VRC+, but even without it it is bad. Forcing something like this onto your users is just wrong in every possible way.\n\nThe fact alone that you (dear vrchat devs) even try to do something like this, let me doubt the whole future of vrchat. In a few years we will probably pay X amount of money and get all different things and popups, stuff hidden behind a paywall, etc.\n\nPlease... please don´t do this... be nice devs!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
