  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Forcing the live now screen open when the game starts does nothing but generate negative response towards whatever you want to show, because it's a frustration to be clicked away from every time you start the game.  \n\nIt does nothing but hold players hostage for engagement, especially in VR, nobody has ever wanted an interaction-overriding forced popup in their program in the history of desktop computing.\n\nIt's especially annoying if you're testing worlds and gonna see it every time you run a test client.",
